    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1203">

                <pb facs="0983" n="867" sameAs="frus:frus1912/pg867"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 812.00/5433.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The American Chargé
                            d’Affaires to the Secretary of
                        State</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Embassy</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Mexico</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1912-11-08T12:00:00-06:36">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">November 8, 1912—12 noon</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Government reports that the rebels around Cuernavaca have been dispersed. Rebel
                    activities in the State of Mexico increasing.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Schuyler.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
